[00:00.00] 作词 : Emily Beihold/Nick Lopez/Andrew DeCaro
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Emily Beihold/Nick Lopez/Andrew DeCaro
[00:09.96]I don't feel a single thing
{"我毫无感觉"}
[00:13.12]Have the pills done too much?
{"是药效过头了吗？"}
[00:16.04]Haven't caught up with my friends in weeks
{"好几周没和朋友们联系了"}
[00:19.59]And now we're outta touch
{"如今我们已断了音讯"}
[00:21.97]I've been driving in LA
{"我一直在洛杉矶开车"}
[00:24.47]And the world, it feels too big
{"而这个世界，感觉太过庞大"}
[00:27.32]Like a floating ball that's bound to break
{"像一颗注定要破裂的飘浮球"}
[00:30.74]Snap my psyche like a twig
{"像折断树枝般击垮我的心智"}
[00:33.12]And I just wanna see
{"而我只想知道"}
[00:35.61]If you feel the same as me
{"你是否和我有同样的感受"}
[00:38.30]Do you ever get a little bit tired of life?
{"你是否也曾对生活感到一丝疲惫？"}
[00:41.39]Like you're not really happy but you don't wanna die
{"像是并非真正快乐，却又不想死去"}
[00:44.09]Like you're hanging by a thread but you gotta survive
{"像是命悬一线，却必须活下去"}
[00:46.94]'Cause you gotta survive
{"因为你必须活下去"}
[00:48.68]Like your body's in the room but you're not really there
{"像是身体在房间里，但灵魂却不在"}
[00:52.63]Like you have empathy inside but you don't really care
{"像是内心有同情，却并不真的在乎"}
[00:55.25]Like you're fresh outta love but it's been in the air
{"像是爱已耗尽，但它曾弥漫在空气中"}
[00:58.10]Am I past repair?
{"我是否已无法挽回？"}
[01:00.17]A little bit tired of trying to care when I don't
{"有点厌倦了在无心时还要努力去在乎"}
[01:05.48]A little bit tired of quick repairs to cope
{"有点厌倦了用权宜之计来应付"}
[01:11.43]A little bit tired of sinking, there's water in my boat
{"有点厌倦了下沉，我的船里进了水"}
[01:15.43]I'm barely breathing, tryna stay afloat
{"我几乎无法呼吸，挣扎着浮在水面"}
[01:18.17]So I got these quick repairs to cope
{"所以我用这些权宜之计来应付"}
[01:22.54]Guess I'm just broken and broke
{"看来我只是身心俱疲，一文不名"}
[01:25.41]The prescription's on its way
{"处方药正在送来"}
[01:29.44]With a name I can't pronounce
{"有个我念不出的名字"}
[01:32.39]And the dose I gotta take
{"还有我必须服下的剂量"}
[01:34.93]Boy, I wish that I could count
{"天啊　真希望我能数得清"}
[01:38.15]'Cause I just wanna see
{"因为我只想知道"}
[01:40.57]If this could make me happy
{"这能否让我快乐起来"}
[01:43.31]Do you ever get a little bit tired of life?
{"你是否也曾对生活感到一丝疲惫？"}
[01:46.24]Like you're not really happy but you don't wanna die
{"好像并非真正快乐　却又不想死去"}
[01:48.95]Like you're hanging by a thread but you gotta survive
{"像是命悬一线　但你必须撑下去"}
[01:51.76]'Cause you gotta survive
{"因为你必须撑下去"}
[01:53.47]Like your body's in the room but you're not really there
{"像是身体在房间里　心却不在那里"}
[01:57.46]Like you have empathy inside but you don't really care
{"像是内心有同情　却并不真的在意"}
[02:00.11]Like you're fresh out of love but it's been in the air
{"像是爱已耗尽　可它明明弥漫在空气里"}
[02:02.98]Am I past repair?
{"我是否已无法挽回？"}
[02:05.00]A little bit tired of trying to care when I don't
{"有点厌倦了在不在乎时还要试着去在乎"}
[02:10.41]A little bit tired of quick repairs to cope
{"有点厌倦了用速效补救来勉强应付"}
[02:16.11]A little bit tired of sinking, there's water in my boat
{"有点厌倦了下沉　我的船里进了水"}
[02:20.28]I'm barely breathing, tryna stay afloat
{"我几乎无法呼吸　挣扎着不沉没"}
[02:23.10]So I got these quick repairs to cope
{"所以我用这些速效补救来勉强应付"}
[02:27.53]Do you ever get a little bit tired of life?
{"你是否也曾对生活感到一丝疲惫？"}
[02:31.78]Like you're not really happy but you don't wanna die
{"好像并非真正快乐　却又不想死去"}
